# Instagram + Buffer

Never publish to Buffer or Instagram until Adam has **confirmed grid order** in chat. Propose left-to-right (newest on the left), then wait.

Do not infer order from a previous sequence. Do not post "backwards" unless that order is approved.

## After approval

- Publish one post at a time. Wait until Buffer status is `sent` before creating the next.
- Instagram grid: last `sent` post sits top-left.
- After a set is live, move the source stills from `_inbox/SELECTED/` to `_inbox/POSTED/`.
